+  <meta name="description" content="A teaching-first companion to TAC-8: The Agentic Layer. Learn to separate application and agentic layers, build a minimum viable agentic layer, compose ADWs, orchestrate multi-agent systems, and prioritize agentics.">
+  <title>TAC-8 · The Agentic Layer — IndyDevDan Expert Book</title>
