+        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">08</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/08-the-agentic-layer.html">The Agentic Layer</a></strong><p>Tactic: Prioritize Agentics · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
