       <div class="lesson-list">
         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">01</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/01-hello-agentic-coding.html">Hello Agentic Coding</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stop Coding · Gold chapter</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">02</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/02-the-12-leverage-points.html">The 12 Leverage Points</a></strong><p>Tactic: Adopt Your Agent’s Perspective · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
