         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">04</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/04-afk-agents.html">AFK Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stay Out The Loop · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">05</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/05-close-the-loops.html">Close the Loops</a></strong><p>Tactic: Always Add Feedback Loops · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">06</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/06-let-your-agents-focus.html">Let Your Agents Focus</a></strong><p>Tactic: One Agent, One Prompt, One Purpose · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
