+          <ol class="lab-box__steps">
+            <li>Enter <code>tac8_app5__nlq_to_sql_aea</code>. Copy <code>app/server/.env.sample</code> to <code>app/server/.env</code>, add the required keys, install the tracked client/server dependencies, and update the course’s machine-specific <code>CLAUDE_CODE_PATH</code> in <code>scripts/aea_server_start.sh</code>.</li>
